; float JSON serde/schema. Kept apart from tests/json/ for the hand-written tests.rs beside it —
; validation against the crate's own emitted schema (a jsonschema dev-dep) and a bit-exact f64 JSON
; round-trip that holds only while the generated manifest carries serde_json's `float_roundtrip`
; feature. The original reason for the split (preserve-encodings could not emit floats, and this
; fixture's twin also runs under json_preserve) is retired: float head widths are encoding variables
; now, so folding back into tests/json/ is open work rather than blocked.
float_holder = [f: float64]
